---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import JoinCallout from '../components/JoinCallout.astro';
import { DOJO_KUN } from '../config.js';
---
<Base
  title="About Our Shotokan Karate Club in Golden, BC"
  description="Golden Shotokan Karate Society is an ISKF member club teaching traditional Shotokan karate in Golden, British Columbia. Our history, lineage and values."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>About the Society</h1>
      <p>A traditional karate club in Golden, British Columbia, and a member of the International Shotokan Karate Federation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap two-col">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Our club</h2>
        <p><strong>Club history to come:</strong> when the club started in Golden, who founded it, where we train, and what we're proud of.</p>
        <h2>What is Shotokan karate?</h2>
        <p>Shotokan is one of the most widely practised styles of karate in the world. It was brought from Okinawa to mainland Japan by Gichin Funakoshi in the early 20th century, and is known for strong, deep stances, powerful linear techniques and an emphasis on kata.</p>
        <h2>The ISKF</h2>
        <p>The International Shotokan Karate Federation (ISKF) was founded in 1977 by Master Teruyuki Okazaki, who trained under Gichin Funakoshi and Masatoshi Nakayama. As an ISKF club, our ranks, gradings and instructor qualifications follow a consistent international standard, and students can train at ISKF dojos and seminars around the world.</p>
        <h2>The dojo kun</h2>
        <p>Every class ends with the five principles of the dojo kun:</p>
        <ol>
          {DOJO_KUN.map((k) => <li>{k.en}</li>)}
        </ol>
        <p><a class="link-more" href="/shotokan">Our lineage, belt ranks and kata</a></p>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/team.jpg" alt="Golden Shotokan Karate Society karate club members in their gis at the dojo in Golden, BC" width="1350" height="734" loading="lazy" style="border-radius:10px" />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>Common karate terms</h2>
      <dl class="terms">
        <dt>Dojo</dt><dd>The training hall</dd>
        <dt>Sensei</dt><dd>Instructor</dd>
        <dt>Gi</dt><dd>Karate uniform</dd>
        <dt>Kihon</dt><dd>Basic techniques</dd>
        <dt>Kata</dt><dd>Set forms of linked techniques</dd>
        <dt>Kumite</dt><dd>Sparring with a partner</dd>
        <dt>Osu</dt><dd>A greeting and acknowledgement used in the dojo</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
  <JoinCallout />
</Base>
